nded-xl p-5 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\" href=\"/blog/trending-pet-names-2025/\"><div class=\"text-3xl mb-3\">🔥</div><span class=\"text-xs bg-primary/10 text-primary font-semibold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full\">Pet Names</span><h3 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-gray-800 mt-2 group-hover:text-primary line-clamp-2\">Trending Pet Names 2025: What&#x27;s Hot Right Now 🔥</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1 line-clamp-2\">Discover the hottest trending pet names for 2025. From vintage comebacks to pop culture influences, see what&#x27;s shaping pet naming this year with 120+ trending names for dogs, cats, and all pets.</p></a><a class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-5 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\" href=\"/blog/best-fish-names-complete-guide/\"><div class=\"text-3xl mb-3\">🐠</div><span class=\"text-xs bg-primary/10 text-primary font-semibold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full\">Pet Names</span><h3 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-gray-800 mt-2 group-hover:text-primary line-clamp-2\">200+ Best Fish Names: The Complete Guide for Every Aquarium Friend</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1 line-clamp-2\">Discover the ultimate collection of fish names organized by type, color, and personality. From betta fish to goldfish, find the perfect name for your aquatic pet.</p></a><a class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-5 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\" href=\"/blog/vintage-retro-pet-names-throwback/\"><div class=\"text-3xl mb-3\">🕰️</div><span class=\"text-xs bg-primary/10 text-primary font-semibold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full\">Pet Names</span><h3 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-gray-800 mt-2 group-hover:text-primary line-clamp-2\">Vintage Pet Names: 100+ Throwback Ideas That Never Go Out of Style 🕰️</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1 line-clamp-2\">Discover 100+ vintage and retro pet names from the 1920s through 1970s. Classic, timeless names for dogs, cats, and all pets that carry charm, history, and enduring style.</p></a></div></section><nav class=\"mt-12 grid grid-cols-2 gap-4\" aria-label=\"Post navigation\"><a class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group text-left\" href=\"/blog/cute-pet-names-every-personality/\"><span class=\"text-xs text-gray-500\">← Previous Post</span><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 group-hover:text-primary mt-1 line-clamp-1\">150 Cute Pet Names for Every Personality Type 💕</p></a><a class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group text-right\" href=\"/blog/first-week-pet-naming-guide/\"><span class=\"text-xs text-gray-500\">Next Post →</span><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 group-hover:text-primary mt-1 line-clamp-1\">First Week Naming Guide: How to Name Your New Pet Right 📝</p></a></nav><div class=\"mt-12 p-6 bg-primary/5 rounded-2xl border border-primary/10 text-center\"><p class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-2\">🐾 Ready to find the perfect animal name?</p><p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-4\">Browse our complete collection of 200+ animal name generators — all 100% free.</p><a class=\"inline-block bg-primary text-white font-bold px-6 py-3 rounded-full hover:bg-primary-dark transition-colors\" href=\"/animals/\">Browse All Animals →</a></div></article><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"bg-gray-900 text-gray-400 py-10\" aria-label=\"Site footer\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-8 mb-8\"><div><h4 class=\"text-white font-semibold text-sm uppercase tracking-wide mb-3\">Company</h4><ul class=\"space-y-2 text-sm\"><li><a class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors\" href=\"/about/\">About</a></li><li><a class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors\" href=\"/editorial-policy/\">Editorial Policy</a></li><li><a class=\"