 Dogs Names — 100+ Ideas 💫\"}]]}]]}]]}]\n3f:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-12\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mb-6\",\"children\":\"📝 Related Articles\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"exotic-pet-names-ultimate-guide\",{\"href\":\"/blog/exotic-pet-names-ultimate-guide/\",\"className\":\"bg-white rounded-xl p-5 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-3xl mb-3\",\"children\":\"🦔\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xs bg-primary/10 text-primary font-semibold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full\",\"children\":\"Exotic Pet Names\"}],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm font-bold text-gray-800 mt-2 group-hover:text-primary line-clamp-2\",\"children\":\"Exotic Pet Names: 130+ Ultimate Ideas for Unique & Unusual Animals\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1 line-clamp-2\",\"children\":\"From hedgehogs to sugar gliders, discover 130+ exotic pet names for unique and unusual animals. Creative, funny, and meaningful names for your extraordinary companion.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"first-week-pet-naming-guide\",{\"href\":\"/blog/first-week-pet-naming-guide/\",\"className\":\"bg-white rounded-xl p-5 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-3xl mb-3\",\"children\":\"📝\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xs bg-primary/10 text-primary font-semibold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full\",\"children\":\"Pet Names\"}],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm font-bold text-gray-800 mt-2 group-hover:text-primary line-clamp-2\",\"children\":\"First Week Naming Guide: How to Name Your New Pet Right 📝\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1 line-clamp-2\",\"children\":