pop culture influences, see what's shaping pet naming this year with 120+ trending names for dogs, cats, and all pets.\"}]]}],\"$L42\",\"$L43\"]}]]}]\n40:[\"$\",\"nav\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-12 grid grid-cols-2 gap-4\",\"aria-label\":\"Post navigation\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L3\",null,{\"href\":\"/blog/cute-pet-names-every-personality/\",\"className\":\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group text-left\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xs text-gray-500\",\"children\":\"← Previous Post\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 group-hover:text-primary mt-1 line-clamp-1\",\"children\":\"150 Cute Pet Names for Every Personality Type 💕\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"$L3\",null,{\"href\":\"/blog/first-week-pet-naming-guide/\",\"className\":\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group text-right\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xs text-gray-500\",\"children\":\"Next Post →\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 group-hover:text-primary mt-1 line-clamp-1\",\"children\":\"First Week Naming Guide: How to Name Your New Pet Right 📝\"}]]}]]}]\n41:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-12 p-6 bg-primary/5 rounded-2xl border border-primary/10 text-center\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-lg font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-2\",\"children\":\"🐾 Ready to find the perfect animal name?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-gray-600 mb-4\",\"children\":\"Browse our complete collection of 200+ animal name generators — all 100% free.\"}],[\"$\",\"$L3\",null,{\"href\":\"/animals/\",\"className\":\"inline-block bg-primary text-white font-bold px-6 py-3 rounded-full hover:bg-primary-dark transition-colors\",\"children\":\"Browse All Animals →\"}]]}]\n42:[\"$\",\"$L3\",\"best-fish-names-complete-guide\",{\